 <h3><u>Faqeer ki sada hussain hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Ya hussain, ya hussain---hussain hussain<br> shah ast hussain, baadshah ast hussain<br> dee'n ast hussain, dee'n panah ast hussain<br> sar daad na daad, dast e dar dast e yazeed<br> haqqaq e binaye laa ilaah ast hussain</p> 
  <p>Faqeer ki sada hussain hai..(4)<br> jo bandagi ka naaz hai..(2)<br> haqeeqat e namaz hai,<br> wo banda e khuda hussain hai..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Nazar hai khaimagaah par<br> zameen o aasmaan ki<br> sukoot mein hai zindagi<br> ghadi hai imtehaan ki<br> hai saans maut ki ruki..(2)<br> laraz rahi hai roshni<br> diya bujha raha hussain hai..(2)</p> 
  <p>2. Ae jaane wale ruk zara<br> udaas kyu hai is qadar<br> qalam hai uske haath mein<br> hussain se to baat kar<br> ye lauh phir banayega<br> tujhe pisar dilayega<br> khuda ka laadla hussain hai..(2)</p> 
  <p>3. Sumo se zuljanah ke<br> ye arsh kyu lipat gaya<br> falak pe mehr ruk gaya<br> faraat peeche hatt gaya<br> hai zalzala zameen ko..(2)<br> abhi to aasteen ko<br> ulatne jaa raha hussain hai..(2)</p> 
  <p>4. Falak pe likhe jaate the<br> naseeb kal ki baat thi<br> kareem ke zahoor se<br> rawish ye ab badal gayi<br> yehi pe hoga sab raqam..(2)<br> uthake lauh aur qalam<br> zamee'n pe aagaya hussain hai..(2)</p> 
  <p>5. Ameer ko salam kar<br> kisine jab ye di sada<br> pukara muslim e ali<br> mai qaid hu to kya hua<br> salam kyu karu ise..(2)<br> pata nahi hai kya tujhe<br> ameer bas mera hussain hai..(2)</p> 
  <p>6. Hussain ne ye tarbiyat<br> batool se hi paayi thi<br> bachali apne khoon se<br> wilayat e ali wali<br> gali gali, nagar nagar..(2)<br> ali ali hai ab magar<br> Ali ke lab pe ya hussain hai..(2)<br> Ya Hussain...</p> 
  <p>7. Ajab safar hai ishq ka<br> sukoon aablo'n mein hai<br> najaf se karbala talak<br> ye shor qaflo'n mein hai<br> chalo hussainiyo chalo..(2)<br> zara sa tez aur chalo<br> tumhe bula raha hussain hai</p> 
  <p>8. Wo apne dost ke liye<br> qaza ka sar utar de<br> majaal kya hai maut ki<br> habeeb ko jo maar de<br> hayaat maut layegi..(2)<br> palat ke ab to aayegi<br> zabaan de chuka hussain hai..(2)</p> 
  <p>9. Takallum e hussainiyat<br> ye uska inteqaam hai<br> ali ki laadli se ab<br> qaza ka sab nizam hai<br> bata rahi hai ye zamee'n..(2)<br> yazeediyat kahi'n nahi<br> jagah jagah pe<br> ya hussain hai, ya hussain, ya hussain hai</p> 
